{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "Recognition", "depth": 2, "parent_id": null, "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.85, "confidence_raw": 0.85, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's been tough.", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's just, sometimes it feels like no matter how hard I try, it's not enough.", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 91}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It’s just, sometimes I wonder if my efforts are even noticed.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Thanks for being here.", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 151}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's hard not to compare.", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 105}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's just... hard to see him get these opportunities and not have anything change for me recently.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "it just... gets to me.", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 133}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I guess I just wish I could feel more recognized at work.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I guess I just wish I could feel more recognized at work. It's hard not to compare.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 83}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "Last week, I got a big project done, but there was no acknowledgment.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 69}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "The project was huge, and I worked really hard on it. But there was no recognition, just Eric getting promoted.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "I wish there was more recognition for my work.", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 148}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Like I should be doing better.", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 147}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "seeing his promotions and posts just… nags at me.", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 55}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I do try, but those feelings are tough to ignore.", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 75}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It's just hard because his achievements are big and public.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 59}, {"session_id": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "those feelings are tough to ignore.", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 75}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261007T101658Z", "last_updated_at": "20261007T103604Z", "first_seen_session": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000286-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
